## 6. The C++ Binding File for the CUDA Extension (`lltm_cuda.cpp`)

This file contains the requested macros (`CHECK_CUDA`, `CHECK_CONTIGUOUS`, `CHECK_INPUT`), `TORCH_CHECK`, the CUDA forward declarations, C++ interface functions, and `PYBIND11_MODULE`:

```cpp
#include <torch/extension.h>

#include <vector>

// CUDA forward declarations

std::vector<torch::Tensor> lltm_cuda_forward(
    torch::Tensor input,
    torch::Tensor weights,
    torch::Tensor bias,
    torch::Tensor old_h,
    torch::Tensor old_cell);

std::vector<torch::Tensor> lltm_cuda_backward(
    torch::Tensor grad_h,
    torch::Tensor grad_cell,
